    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a Fantasy World Filled with Bubbles and Cheerleaders, and Spark the Flames of Passion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a seamless blend of alluring visuals and puzzle gameplay that\u2019s simple yet captivating. <br>Rescue the characters trapped within bubbles, and after each stage, the <strong>Bubble Girl</strong> will dazzle you with her irresistible charm. <br>Make it to the fourth stage for each character, and you'll unlock moments of fiery romance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/562612da5a5092bd98fa057873d0cadc.poster.avif?t=1736589041\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/562612da5a5092bd98fa057873d0cadc.webm?t=1736589041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/562612da5a5092bd98fa057873d0cadc.mp4?t=1736589041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Cheerleaders:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six stunning cheerleaders, each with their own unique personality, style, and preferences. Who will capture your heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/4b33ae552af5a7d79580ef2fbbee0d10.poster.avif?t=1736589041\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/4b33ae552af5a7d79580ef2fbbee0d10.webm?t=1736589041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/4b33ae552af5a7d79580ef2fbbee0d10.mp4?t=1736589041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Gorgeous Characters</strong> <br>Each cheerleader boasts a distinctive personality, taste, and style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24+ Dynamic Images</strong> <br>Not just stills! Enjoy over 24 high-quality Live 2D animations that bring the characters to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth &amp; Natural Motion</strong> <br>Crafted by top-tier animators, experience fluid and realistic character movements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple yet Addictive Puzzles</strong> <br>Intuitive gameplay that\u2019s easy to pick up, with delightful surprises along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>User-Friendly Gallery Design</strong> <br>Revisit your favorite scenes effortlessly with an intuitive gallery system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Girl delivers an unforgettable experience, blending simple puzzles with steamy rewards. Start your journey now and create memories that will stay with you forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/cb15b51285dc15645256a6064ad92729.avif?t=1736589041\" width=699 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Goals &amp; Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on your support and engagement, we promise exciting updates to keep the fun alive!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10,000 Sales Milestone</strong> <br>Additional animations will be added to each character's fourth scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30,000 Sales Milestone</strong> <br>A new character joins the lineup, complete with four new scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50,000 Sales Milestone</strong> <br>Each character will receive one additional scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100,000 Sales Milestone</strong> <br>Customization options will be added to all characters' fourth scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>150,000 Sales Milestone</strong> <br>Each character will get 2\u20133 new outfits to enhance the new customization features.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200,000 Sales Milestone</strong> <br>Customization will expand to include all scenes for every character.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself for a thrilling new experience with <strong>Bubble Girl</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369110/extras/1f0eeff6a79d0b8347459ed3448742cb.avif?t=1736589041\" width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
